   "page": "cabinet",
   "text": "DATA MODEL (for devs)\nStudent → Assignments (lesson | material, ready_for_student = true) → shown in cabinet.\nLesson: id, number, date, title, note_from_nina, topics[], materials[] (ordered by Nina), homework[].\nMaterial: id, type (card | vocab | dialogue | story | video | audio | document | grammar | exercise | game | pronunciation | reader | review | checkpoint), title, files[], topics[], is_personal, is_homework, due_date.\nProgress per student×material: not_started | opened | completed.\nExercise: structured JSON + template_id → rendered by the shared Exercise Frame (C6). New templates plug into the frame; no cabinet redesign.\n\nNavigation (max 5): Home · Lessons · Materials · Vocabulary · Progress. Desktop = left sidebar; mobile = bottom tab bar.\nNo public sign-up. No dark mode. No textbook names anywhere.",
   "w": 420,
   "x": 6100,
   "y": 0
  },
  "n_cab_status": {
   "fill": "green",
   "maxH": 560,
   "page": "cabinet",
   "text": "STATUS LANGUAGE\nLesson: ახალი (new, teal-soft) · მიმდინარე (in progress, mustard-soft) · დასრულებული (done, sage).\nMaterial: not started = empty ring · opened = half ring · completed = sage check.\n„Mark as done“ = student action; exercises auto-complete on the completion screen.\nHomework: burgundy-soft chip + due date.",
   "w": 420,
   "x": 6100,
   "y": 1000
  },
