   "maxH": 640,
   "page": "landing",
   "text": "Rhythm: Lively → Calm alternates.\nHero (L) · Meet Nina (C) · Different (L) · Stories (L, navy) · How a lesson works (C) · Materials (L) · Cabinet (C) · Poco a Poco path (C) · Gift (L) · Pricing (C) · FAQ (C) · Final CTA (L) · Footer.\n\nPrimary CTA „დაჯავშნე საცდელი გაკვეთილი“ appears 6× (header, hero, stories, gift, pricing, final). Every CTA opens the Booking modal (desktop) / full-screen sheet (mobile).\n\nDesktop is split in two artboards only because of canvas height limits — it is one continuous page.\n\nInteractive on desktop (press Play): dialogue translation toggle, Spanish in Action pad, FAQ accordion.\n\nHeader on scroll: 88→68px, cream bg, 1px sand divider (see Design system › Header states).",
